{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 主流框架MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"CrewAI的角色定义与任务编排\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"主流框架\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/主流框架\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"CrewAI的角色定义与任务编排\" dir=\"auto\">CrewAI的角色定义与任务编排</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细说明CrewAI框架的核心抽象（Agent、Task、Crew、Process），以及它是如何通过角色扮演和流程驱动实现多智能体协作的。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>CrewAI的核心理念</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">CrewAI是一个基于<strong>角色扮演（Role-Playing）</strong>和<strong>流程驱动（Process-Driven）</strong>的多智能体协作框架。其设计灵感来源于人类团队协作——每个Agent有明确的角色、目标和背景故事，通过协作完成复杂任务。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>四大核心抽象：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>Agent（智能体）</strong>：具有角色、目标、背景故事的\"数字员工\"</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">role</code>：角色定义（如\"研究员\"、\"作家\"）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">goal</code>：角色目标（如\"收集最新AI信息\"）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">backstory</code>：背景故事（塑造Agent的行为风格）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">tools</code>：专属工具集</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">allow_delegation</code>：是否允许委派任务</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>Task（任务）</strong>：分配给Agent的具体工作单元</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">description</code>：任务描述</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">expected_output</code>：期望输出格式</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">agent</code>：负责执行的Agent</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">context</code>：依赖的其他任务输出</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>Crew（团队）</strong>：将Agents和Tasks组装成可执行单元</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">负责整体执行流程管理</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>Process（流程）</strong>：任务分配与执行的策略</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">sequential</code>：顺序执行</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">hierarchical</code>：层级执行（经理Agent委派）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示例：构建AI研究团队协作系统</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> crewai <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Crew<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Process\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain_openai <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> ChatOpenAI\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 定义研究员Agent</span>\nresearcher <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    role<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"高级研究员\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    goal<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"收集和分析AI Agent领域的最新研究进展\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    backstory<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"你是一位在AI领域有10年经验的资深研究员，擅长从学术论\"</span>\n              <span class=\"token string\">\"文和技术博客中提取关键信息，并形成结构化的研究报告。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    verbose<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    allow_delegation<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">False</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    tools<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>search_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> scrape_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    llm<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>ChatOpenAI<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> temperature<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0.3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 定义写作Agent</span>\nwriter <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    role<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"技术作家\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    goal<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"将研究成果转化为通俗易懂的技术文章\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    backstory<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"你是一位技术专栏作家，擅长将复杂的技术概念用\"</span>\n              <span class=\"token string\">\"简洁生动的语言表达出来，让读者轻松理解。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    verbose<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    allow_delegation<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">False</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    llm<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>ChatOpenAI<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> temperature<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0.7</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 定义审查Agent</span>\nreviewer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    role<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"内容审查员\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    goal<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"确保文章的技术准确性和表达质量\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    backstory<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"你是一位严谨的技术编辑，会仔细检查文章中的\"</span>\n              <span class=\"token string\">\"每一个技术细节，确保准确无误。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    verbose<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    allow_delegation<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">False</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    llm<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>ChatOpenAI<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> temperature<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0.2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 定义任务</span>\nresearch_task <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Task<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    description<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"搜索并整理2024-2025年AI Agent领域的重要进展，\"</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"包括新框架、协议和应用案例。输出结构化的研究报告。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    expected_output<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"包含以下部分的研究报告：1.新框架发布 2.重要协议 \"</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"3.典型应用案例 4.技术趋势分析\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    agent<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>researcher\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\nwriting_task <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Task<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    description<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"基于研究报告撰写一篇技术博客文章，面向AI开发者。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    expected_output<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"一篇2000字左右的技术博客，包含引言、正文和总结\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    agent<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>writer<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    context<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>research_task<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 依赖研究任务的输出</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\nreview_task <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Task<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    description<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"审查技术博客的技术准确性和表达质量，提出修改建议。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    expected_output<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"审查报告，包含技术错误列表和修改建议\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    agent<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>reviewer<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    context<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>writing_task<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 组装团队 - 顺序执行模式</span>\ncrew <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Crew<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    agents<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>researcher<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> writer<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reviewer<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    tasks<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>research_task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> writing_task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> review_task<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    process<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>Process<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>sequential<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 顺序执行</span>\n    verbose<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 执行任务</span>\nresult <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> crew<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>kickoff<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>两种Process模式对比：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Sequential</strong></td>\n<td>任务按顺序执行，前一个输出作为后一个输入</td>\n<td>有明确依赖关系的线性流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Hierarchical</strong></td>\n<td>引入Manager Agent动态委派任务</td>\n<td>复杂项目需要统一协调</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：CrewAI的<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">context</code>参数如何工作？任务间的数据如何传递？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">context</code>指定任务依赖关系，被依赖任务的输出会自动作为上下文传递给下游任务。CrewAI内部维护任务输出映射表。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：CrewAI与LangGraph相比各有什么优劣？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：CrewAI高层抽象、开箱即用，适合快速原型和角色扮演场景；LangGraph更底层、控制更精细，适合需要复杂控制流的生产环境。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：CrewAI的Agent是独立运行的进程。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：CrewAI的Agent是逻辑抽象，实际运行在Python进程中，通过LLM调用的上下文区分不同角色，而非真正的独立进程。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}